<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Date: [&#9679;], 2026</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Curvature Securities, LLC</P>

